    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the public health law, in relation to newborn screening for\nadrenoleukodystrophy and glucose-6-phosphate dehydrogenase deficiency",
    "basePrintNo": "S4316",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S4316-2021",
